1
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,430
This is where it happened.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,590
Actually, it's quite normal

3
00:00:12,590 --> 00:00:13,830
for sisters to have disagreements.

4
00:00:13,910 --> 00:00:15,320
That's just how Ms. Zheng

5
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:16,760
got along with her family.

6
00:00:16,760 --> 00:00:18,320
Sometimes they'd argue one day,

7
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:19,320
and the next day, her second sister

8
00:00:19,320 --> 00:00:21,760
would still bring her
a home-cooked meal.

9
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:22,870
A lot of families

10
00:00:22,870 --> 00:00:24,320
get along like that.

11
00:00:24,350 --> 00:00:25,760
And at the time,

12
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:27,960
our company
really was having cash flow problems.

13
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,230
None of them really understood
what Ms. Zheng was dealing with.

14
00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:31,350
So,

15
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:33,710
is Zheng Ling's eldest sister
still in the hospital

16
00:00:33,710 --> 00:00:34,750
waiting for treatment?

17
00:00:34,750 --> 00:00:35,390
Yes.

18
00:00:35,390 --> 00:00:38,390
The doctors actually said long ago
that she couldn't be cured.

19
00:00:38,520 --> 00:00:40,640
The treatment is only to do
whatever they can for her.

20
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:41,790
Understood.

21
00:00:42,750 --> 00:00:43,560
Jiang.

22
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:45,070
Let's go find Zheng Jing.

23
00:00:45,070 --> 00:00:45,790
Officer,

24
00:00:45,960 --> 00:00:47,470
was it really not Nie Yifeng?

25
00:00:48,280 --> 00:00:49,070
Sorry.

26
00:00:49,150 --> 00:00:50,390
We're still investigating,

27
00:00:50,390 --> 00:00:51,430
so we can't disclose that.

28
00:00:51,670 --> 00:00:52,640
Thank you for your cooperation.

29
00:00:58,350 --> 00:00:59,150
Mr. Zhang.

30
00:00:59,420 --> 00:01:01,520
Why did that officer come back again?

31
00:01:01,520 --> 00:01:02,790
Did something happen?

32
00:01:02,790 --> 00:01:03,560
Mr. Zhang,

33
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:05,790
I'm afraid your deal with Ms. Zheng

34
00:01:05,950 --> 00:01:07,680
will have to be put on hold for now.

35
00:01:08,710 --> 00:01:10,370
Something happened to Ms. Zheng.

36
00:01:10,370 --> 00:01:11,360
That won't work.

37
00:01:11,920 --> 00:01:13,480
We're in urgent need of

38
00:01:13,480 --> 00:01:15,150
funding to keep us afloat.

39
00:01:15,150 --> 00:01:16,480
Look, we already

40
00:01:16,560 --> 00:01:17,950
reached a preliminary agreement.

41
00:01:17,950 --> 00:01:18,710
Just tell me,

42
00:01:18,710 --> 00:01:21,790
who can handle this matter
at the company now?

43
00:01:22,120 --> 00:01:22,920
Mr. Zhang,

44
00:01:23,120 --> 00:01:24,150
with Ms. Zheng away,

45
00:01:24,310 --> 00:01:26,000
none of us can make that decision.

46
00:01:26,310 --> 00:01:27,920
Please come back another time.

47
00:01:31,450 --> 00:01:32,180
All right.

48
00:01:46,760 --> 00:01:47,450
Hello?

49
00:01:49,470 --> 00:01:50,100
Zheng Jing.

50
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:52,120
You've been exposed.

51
00:01:54,500 --> 00:01:58,500
=Medical Examiner Dr. Qin: Bones of the Past=
=Episode 20=

52
00:02:01,200 --> 00:02:03,150
Jiang, check the kitchen.

53
00:02:03,150 --> 00:02:03,870
Yes.

54
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:36,080
Captain Lin.

55
00:02:36,190 --> 00:02:37,000
I found something.

56
00:02:43,910 --> 00:02:45,120
The patterns match.

57
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:46,630
Zheng Jing is a major suspect.

58
00:02:57,190 --> 00:02:58,360
There are two sets of footprints.

59
00:02:58,520 --> 00:02:59,520
One set is smaller

60
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:01,750
and probably belongs to a woman.

61
00:03:01,800 --> 00:03:02,870
The other is larger,

62
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:04,630
with short, shuffling steps.

63
00:03:04,630 --> 00:03:05,840
The person tends to walk on their heels.

64
00:03:05,870 --> 00:03:08,240
The person is probably older.

65
00:03:12,080 --> 00:03:14,710
Those steps and the way
this person walks

66
00:03:16,360 --> 00:03:17,910
look familiar.

67
00:03:28,430 --> 00:03:29,560
That man at Zheng Ling's company.

68
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:31,080
What did the assistant call him?

69
00:03:31,080 --> 00:03:32,080
I think it was

70
00:03:33,400 --> 00:03:34,120
Mr. Zhang.

71
00:03:34,120 --> 00:03:35,310
Notify the team immediately.

72
00:03:35,430 --> 00:03:37,120
Check all the nearby
surveillance footage.

73
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:39,000
Find out when Zheng Jing and Mr. Zhang

74
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:40,150
left this place.

75
00:03:40,470 --> 00:03:41,520
And look into Mr. Zhang

76
00:03:41,520 --> 00:03:42,360
and find out exactly who he is.

77
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:43,000
Yes.

78
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:44,190
Mr. Zhuang.

79
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:46,310
Mr. Zhuang.

80
00:03:46,560 --> 00:03:47,360
Mr. Zhuang.

81
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:50,630
Mr. Zhuang, slow down.

82
00:03:55,710 --> 00:03:56,750
What did you call me?

83
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:59,000
My name is Zhang Jinbu,

84
00:03:59,310 --> 00:04:00,560
not Zhuang Haitao.

85
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:03,470
Think about
what Zheng Ling did to your sister.

86
00:04:03,560 --> 00:04:05,560
Think about what you did to Zheng Ling.

87
00:04:05,840 --> 00:04:07,400
There's no turning back now.

88
00:04:07,870 --> 00:04:09,520
Slowing down now means waiting to die.

89
00:04:10,080 --> 00:04:10,870
Do you understand?

90
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:22,040
Zheng Jing.

91
00:04:23,830 --> 00:04:24,720
Who are you?

92
00:04:24,830 --> 00:04:26,190
My name is Zhang Jinbu.

93
00:04:26,510 --> 00:04:29,040
I'm your sister Zheng Ling's
former business partner.

94
00:04:30,680 --> 00:04:31,680
I've never heard of you.

95
00:04:34,430 --> 00:04:35,920
Of course she wouldn't mention me.

96
00:04:36,510 --> 00:04:38,310
She ruined me.

97
00:04:39,270 --> 00:04:40,800
We started a company together,

98
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:42,240
but she forced me out.

99
00:04:42,240 --> 00:04:43,190
She still hasn't paid me

100
00:04:43,190 --> 00:04:44,560
the money she owes me.

101
00:04:44,870 --> 00:04:45,950
Then go find her.

102
00:04:45,950 --> 00:04:47,310
Why are you coming to me?

103
00:04:47,430 --> 00:04:49,000
Do you know how your sister

104
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:51,270
started her company?

105
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:52,360
She said

106
00:04:53,270 --> 00:04:54,070
it was a loan.

107
00:04:57,120 --> 00:05:00,560
Back then, your father hid a stash
of gold in the Little White Villa.

108
00:05:00,870 --> 00:05:02,480
Later, when the house was demolished,

109
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:03,830
it all went to her.

110
00:05:03,830 --> 00:05:05,070
How is that possible?

111
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:07,720
Why would I lie to you?

112
00:05:08,740 --> 00:05:11,870
Think about the kind of life you
and your eldest sister

113
00:05:11,870 --> 00:05:13,510
have lived all these years,

114
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:15,750
and the kind of life she's been living.

115
00:05:15,830 --> 00:05:19,720
Zheng Ling lives in a mansion
and drives a luxury car.

116
00:05:21,560 --> 00:05:22,870
Has she ever cared about you?

117
00:05:24,120 --> 00:05:24,920
And

118
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:28,120
did you tell Zheng Ling

119
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:29,920
about your eldest sister's lung cancer?

120
00:05:31,300 --> 00:05:33,220
(Longfan City First Hospital.
Statement of Charges. Zheng Hong)

121
00:05:34,950 --> 00:05:35,750
Yes.

122
00:05:36,070 --> 00:05:36,870
She said

123
00:05:37,190 --> 00:05:38,270
she had no money.

124
00:05:38,390 --> 00:05:39,270
No money?

125
00:05:39,390 --> 00:05:41,310
Her car alone is worth enough

126
00:05:41,310 --> 00:05:42,920
to pay for three
of your eldest sister's surgeries.

127
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:44,950
Your eldest sister worked

128
00:05:45,070 --> 00:05:46,480
to put her through school.

129
00:05:46,630 --> 00:05:47,830
Now that she's sick,

130
00:05:47,830 --> 00:05:50,000
Zheng Ling won't even give her
the money that could save her life.

131
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:51,510
How can she even be considered human?

132
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:54,000
She wasn't like this before.

133
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:55,920
Now that she's rich,

134
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:57,390
she just can't be bothered
to pretend anymore.

135
00:05:57,680 --> 00:05:59,190
Your eldest sister is lying in bed,

136
00:05:59,680 --> 00:06:00,480
waiting to die,

137
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:01,830
while she posts photos

138
00:06:02,070 --> 00:06:04,270
of herself eating, drinking,
and having fun.

139
00:06:06,270 --> 00:06:07,870
Has she ever cared about you?

140
00:06:10,240 --> 00:06:11,240
In her eyes,

141
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:14,600
we've never mattered.

142
00:06:14,830 --> 00:06:15,630
Jing.

143
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:16,920
Tell me the truth.

144
00:06:18,270 --> 00:06:19,360
Do you hate her?

145
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:22,720
Yes.

146
00:06:23,070 --> 00:06:24,190
Good. You should hate her.

147
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:26,630
She doesn't deserve to be your sister.

148
00:06:26,630 --> 00:06:27,950
She's just a stranger.

149
00:06:27,950 --> 00:06:29,630
She'd rather see you both dead.

150
00:06:29,630 --> 00:06:31,510
Then there'd be no one left to fight her
for the family property.

151
00:06:31,510 --> 00:06:32,270
Do you understand?

152
00:06:32,390 --> 00:06:34,070
What does she really want?

153
00:06:34,310 --> 00:06:35,870
She only cares about herself.

154
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:37,360
Jing.

155
00:06:38,160 --> 00:06:39,680
I just want you to take back

156
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:41,190
what rightfully belongs to you.

157
00:06:41,510 --> 00:06:42,480
That gold,

158
00:06:42,480 --> 00:06:43,600
since it belonged to your father,

159
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:45,120
should be divided equally
among you sisters.

160
00:06:45,120 --> 00:06:46,600
Why should she keep it all for herself?

161
00:06:47,750 --> 00:06:48,560
Yes.

162
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:51,800
She doesn't care about us as sisters.

163
00:06:52,040 --> 00:06:53,160
That gold

164
00:06:53,360 --> 00:06:54,920
should be divided equally among us.

165
00:06:59,270 --> 00:07:00,830
What do you want me to do?

166
00:07:04,070 --> 00:07:05,000
Find a chance

167
00:07:06,190 --> 00:07:08,070
to put this in her food.

168
00:07:09,190 --> 00:07:10,510
I'll tell you what to do after that.

169
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:13,240
What... What is this?

170
00:07:13,240 --> 00:07:14,510
What will happen if she takes it?

171
00:07:15,750 --> 00:07:17,040
She'll just fall asleep.

172
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:18,560
Don't worry.

173
00:07:22,560 --> 00:07:24,680
She's still my own sister.

174
00:07:26,360 --> 00:07:28,360
Has she ever treated you
like her own sister?

175
00:07:42,360 --> 00:07:43,870
Think it through.

176
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:49,160
Your sister's life

177
00:07:49,430 --> 00:07:50,480
depends on you.

178
00:08:30,340 --> 00:08:35,620
(Medicine)

179
00:08:37,060 --> 00:08:41,260
(Picking Up Medication)

180
00:08:56,840 --> 00:08:57,630
Honey.

181
00:08:57,720 --> 00:08:58,720
Comrade Qin Tian.

182
00:08:59,120 --> 00:09:00,200
You've gone too far.

183
00:09:00,390 --> 00:09:03,080
Zhuang did get tested for AIDS,

184
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:04,630
but he hasn't been diagnosed with AIDS.

185
00:09:04,630 --> 00:09:06,240
Why did you make me
trick him into taking medicine?

186
00:09:06,240 --> 00:09:08,120
It's just vitamins. They won't hurt him.

187
00:09:08,120 --> 00:09:09,720
Haven't you ever tricked
Ming into taking medicine?

188
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:10,960
That's not the same.

189
00:09:11,550 --> 00:09:13,150
Wait, what's wrong with your voice?

190
00:09:15,390 --> 00:09:16,550
You keep saying I'm weak

191
00:09:16,550 --> 00:09:17,790
and in poor health,

192
00:09:17,790 --> 00:09:19,120
and making me
that old hen and ginseng soup.

193
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:20,270
Now it's given me
too much internal heat.

194
00:09:20,270 --> 00:09:22,000
I can barely speak, you know?

195
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:22,790
All right.

196
00:09:22,790 --> 00:09:24,510
Then I'll get you something
to clear the heat.

197
00:09:24,510 --> 00:09:25,720
All right, enough messing around.

198
00:09:25,870 --> 00:09:26,870
I need to talk to you
about something serious.

199
00:09:27,120 --> 00:09:28,080
Sorry for causing trouble

200
00:09:28,870 --> 00:09:30,440
for your hospital
because of this situation with Zhuang.

201
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:31,910
But I still feel

202
00:09:31,910 --> 00:09:33,670
that Zhuang doesn't
seem like a bad person.

203
00:09:33,670 --> 00:09:35,270
I hope he's not a bad person either.

204
00:09:35,270 --> 00:09:36,550
But only after we get
to the bottom of this

205
00:09:36,550 --> 00:09:38,390
will we know whether he's good or bad.

206
00:09:38,960 --> 00:09:39,750
Right?

207
00:09:40,630 --> 00:09:41,440
By the way,

208
00:09:42,750 --> 00:09:43,840
there's something
I want to discuss with you.

209
00:09:44,790 --> 00:09:45,840
For the next few days after work,

210
00:09:45,840 --> 00:09:46,750
could you pick up Ming

211
00:09:46,750 --> 00:09:48,200
and come eat with me at the bureau?

212
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:49,840
The cafeteria has a new cook.

213
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:51,480
The food is really good.

214
00:09:51,480 --> 00:09:52,240
How about it?

215
00:09:54,960 --> 00:09:57,390
That doesn't sound like
something you'd say.

216
00:09:57,510 --> 00:09:58,600
What's gotten into you?

217
00:09:58,790 --> 00:09:59,750
The older I get,

218
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:01,390
the more I depend on you.

219
00:10:02,670 --> 00:10:03,200
All right.

220
00:10:03,200 --> 00:10:04,910
Enough with the sappy talk.

221
00:10:05,360 --> 00:10:06,150
All right.

222
00:10:06,240 --> 00:10:07,320
Get back to work.

223
00:10:07,630 --> 00:10:09,080
Thank you for your cooperation.

224
00:10:10,200 --> 00:10:11,000
Good luck.

225
00:10:11,750 --> 00:10:12,790
I promise I'll get it done.

226
00:10:12,790 --> 00:10:13,670
Officer,

227
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:16,000
is there any news about my daughter?

228
00:10:16,270 --> 00:10:17,270
Not yet.

229
00:10:17,480 --> 00:10:19,000
We're still looking for her.

230
00:10:19,240 --> 00:10:20,390
We asked you here today

231
00:10:20,390 --> 00:10:23,670
mainly to learn a few things
about your son-in-law,

232
00:10:23,960 --> 00:10:25,480
Zhuang Haitao.

233
00:10:26,080 --> 00:10:27,240
From what we understand,

234
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:28,720
after the train bombing,

235
00:10:28,750 --> 00:10:30,510
your granddaughter died.

236
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:31,870
But

237
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:33,840
we've heard some rumors

238
00:10:33,840 --> 00:10:36,750
that your daughter Liu Yan

239
00:10:36,790 --> 00:10:39,200
was having an affair with Huo Qicheng,
the general manager

240
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:40,790
of the Urban Construction Group.

241
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:42,270
Have you ever heard anything about that?

242
00:10:42,510 --> 00:10:43,200
No.

243
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:44,080
That's impossible.

244
00:10:44,270 --> 00:10:45,750
That... That has to be a rumor.

245
00:10:45,910 --> 00:10:47,150
Is it possible

246
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:49,150
that Zhuang Haitao heard the rumor?

247
00:10:49,600 --> 00:10:50,630
You mean

248
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:52,150
Zhuang Haitao...

249
00:10:52,870 --> 00:10:53,750
No.

250
00:10:54,670 --> 00:10:56,480
He... he loves my daughter very much.

251
00:10:57,270 --> 00:10:58,360
He's actually

252
00:10:58,360 --> 00:10:59,960
a very dependable man.

253
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:02,600
He used to be a construction contractor.

254
00:11:02,910 --> 00:11:05,030
He was usually at construction sites
and rarely came home.

255
00:11:05,720 --> 00:11:06,960
He... He loves his child very much.

256
00:11:06,960 --> 00:11:07,960
Whenever he came home,

257
00:11:07,960 --> 00:11:09,320
he'd take them out together.

258
00:11:09,510 --> 00:11:10,550
He... He wouldn't do that.

259
00:11:10,550 --> 00:11:12,030
But during our investigation,

260
00:11:13,120 --> 00:11:14,360
we also heard some other rumors.

261
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:17,000
Huo Qicheng had many women around him.

262
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:18,360
Your daughter Liu Yan

263
00:11:18,870 --> 00:11:20,240
was one of them.

264
00:11:20,550 --> 00:11:21,870
After something happened to Huo Qicheng,

265
00:11:22,510 --> 00:11:23,910
your daughter disappeared too.

266
00:11:25,390 --> 00:11:26,240
I remember

267
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:28,440
you told us last time

268
00:11:29,030 --> 00:11:31,480
that your daughter and Zhuang Haitao

269
00:11:31,870 --> 00:11:32,870
often argued.

270
00:11:36,150 --> 00:11:37,030
Arguments

271
00:11:37,960 --> 00:11:38,790
between a married couple

272
00:11:40,390 --> 00:11:41,600
are normal, aren't they?

273
00:11:49,150 --> 00:11:50,080
Mr. Liu,

274
00:11:50,670 --> 00:11:52,120
if you don't tell us the truth,

275
00:11:52,120 --> 00:11:54,670
it'll be very difficult for us
to uncover the truth of the case.

276
00:11:54,670 --> 00:11:55,550
Mr. Liu,

277
00:11:56,750 --> 00:11:58,120
we really do want to help you.

278
00:12:02,030 --> 00:12:04,510
Yan would cry
whenever she talked about it.

279
00:12:05,030 --> 00:12:07,550
She said she was just
a puppet at the company.

280
00:12:07,750 --> 00:12:09,000
She didn't want things
to be that way either.

281
00:12:09,120 --> 00:12:10,480
But what choice did she have?

282
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:11,270
Even if she refused,

283
00:12:11,320 --> 00:12:12,840
they would force her to do it.

284
00:12:12,960 --> 00:12:14,600
The hardest part
was facing my son-in-law.

285
00:12:14,600 --> 00:12:16,120
Haitao was very sensitive.

286
00:12:17,080 --> 00:12:18,870
She was afraid he wouldn't believe her
if she told him the truth,

287
00:12:18,870 --> 00:12:20,670
but she couldn't
bring herself to lie to him either.

288
00:12:21,150 --> 00:12:24,630
She... She suffered so much.

289
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:25,790
Later,

290
00:12:26,440 --> 00:12:28,720
Zhuang Haitao found out.

291
00:12:28,750 --> 00:12:29,550
They

292
00:12:31,240 --> 00:12:32,630
had a terrible fight over it.

293
00:12:35,840 --> 00:12:36,840
You should have

294
00:12:37,750 --> 00:12:39,510
told us all this much earlier.

295
00:12:40,550 --> 00:12:41,360
I...

296
00:12:43,960 --> 00:12:44,910
Ming.

297
00:12:45,270 --> 00:12:46,240
Calling Ming.

298
00:12:47,200 --> 00:12:48,080
Copy. Go ahead.

299
00:12:49,480 --> 00:12:50,270
Son,

300
00:12:50,910 --> 00:12:52,080
help me look someone up.

301
00:12:52,750 --> 00:12:54,270
His name is Zhuang Haitao.

302
00:12:54,390 --> 00:12:55,960
See what he's doing

303
00:12:55,960 --> 00:12:56,910
thirty years from now.

304
00:12:57,030 --> 00:12:57,910
Zhuang Haitao?

305
00:13:02,120 --> 00:13:03,550
Zhuang Haitao, Liu Yan's husband?

306
00:13:05,440 --> 00:13:06,480
You know about him too?

307
00:13:06,910 --> 00:13:07,910
And you know Liu Yan?

308
00:13:08,080 --> 00:13:08,870
That's right.

309
00:13:09,030 --> 00:13:10,320
We have a case here

310
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:11,960
called the Riverside Skeleton Case.

311
00:13:12,320 --> 00:13:13,870
DNA testing confirmed

312
00:13:13,870 --> 00:13:14,750
that the victim was Liu Yan.

313
00:13:15,120 --> 00:13:17,390
We also looked into
her husband, Zhuang Haitao.

314
00:13:17,720 --> 00:13:18,870
He's been missing for a long time.

315
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:20,200
You mean

316
00:13:20,840 --> 00:13:22,630
Liu Yan is dead,

317
00:13:23,240 --> 00:13:27,150
and Zhuang Haitao wasn't around in 2020?

318
00:13:27,600 --> 00:13:28,150
Then he...

319
00:13:28,270 --> 00:13:29,670
Are you sure he went missing?

320
00:13:31,870 --> 00:13:32,480
Yes.

321
00:13:33,150 --> 00:13:34,320
We were never able to find him,

322
00:13:34,840 --> 00:13:36,000
so he's considered missing.

323
00:13:36,840 --> 00:13:38,080
Then something doesn't add up.

324
00:13:38,360 --> 00:13:39,600
According to the butterfly effect,

325
00:13:39,630 --> 00:13:41,320
if we didn't catch Zhuang Haitao,

326
00:13:41,600 --> 00:13:43,600
then he must have lived until 2020.

327
00:13:43,600 --> 00:13:44,670
But you can't find any trace of him.

328
00:13:44,670 --> 00:13:46,120
There's only one possibility.

329
00:13:47,870 --> 00:13:49,120
- He assumed a new identity.
- He assumed a new identity.

330
00:13:51,510 --> 00:13:53,750
But what identity did he take?

331
00:13:53,750 --> 00:13:55,240
Ming, do you remember

332
00:13:55,630 --> 00:13:57,360
I told you about someone
breaking into our home?

333
00:13:57,360 --> 00:13:58,840
And around the time
of Zhang Daxin's case,

334
00:13:58,960 --> 00:14:01,240
you were in danger as a child.

335
00:14:01,670 --> 00:14:03,320
That person might
have been Zhuang Haitao.

336
00:14:03,560 --> 00:14:05,910
He may already know
that we're in contact,

337
00:14:06,030 --> 00:14:07,750
which is why he tried to hurt you.

338
00:14:07,910 --> 00:14:09,480
Could it be

339
00:14:10,360 --> 00:14:12,550
that he went after you in 2020?

340
00:14:12,550 --> 00:14:13,390
But recently,

341
00:14:13,390 --> 00:14:15,270
nothing unusual has happened around me.

342
00:14:17,720 --> 00:14:18,750
Except for one thing.

343
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:20,550
What case?

344
00:14:20,790 --> 00:14:21,600
Actually,

345
00:14:21,840 --> 00:14:23,510
ever since we made contact,

346
00:14:23,550 --> 00:14:25,000
the cases happening around me

347
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:26,510
have all been connected to 1990.

348
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:28,080
But there's only this one case

349
00:14:28,870 --> 00:14:29,600
where I still haven't found

350
00:14:29,600 --> 00:14:31,270
the connection to 1990.

351
00:14:31,670 --> 00:14:33,510
The victim's name is Zheng Ling.

352
00:14:36,270 --> 00:14:37,080
Zheng Ling?

353
00:14:37,750 --> 00:14:38,790
Let me think.

354
00:14:40,390 --> 00:14:41,790
Doesn't she have two sisters?

355
00:14:42,200 --> 00:14:43,000
Yes.

356
00:14:43,270 --> 00:14:44,910
Then it all makes sense.

357
00:14:45,390 --> 00:14:47,440
The three sisters' father is Zheng Wei.

358
00:14:47,630 --> 00:14:48,440
We now suspect

359
00:14:48,440 --> 00:14:50,240
Zheng Wei and Zhuang Haitao
committed a crime together.

360
00:14:50,240 --> 00:14:51,200
But now Zheng Wei has also

361
00:14:51,200 --> 00:14:52,720
disappeared without a trace.

362
00:14:52,960 --> 00:14:53,750
But Zhuang Haitao

363
00:14:53,750 --> 00:14:56,030
didn't continue living
under Zheng Wei's identity.

364
00:14:56,200 --> 00:14:57,510
So in 2020,

365
00:14:58,480 --> 00:14:59,600
who exactly is he?

366
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:00,790
Right.

367
00:15:01,480 --> 00:15:03,200
What did you say the investor
in Zheng Ling's company

368
00:15:03,200 --> 00:15:04,240
was called again?

369
00:15:04,550 --> 00:15:06,120
I think his name was Zhang Jinbu.

370
00:15:06,790 --> 00:15:07,840
Zhang Jinbu.

371
00:15:12,000 --> 00:15:12,960
Zhang Jinbu.

372
00:15:25,340 --> 00:15:27,700
(Police Line)

373
00:15:34,550 --> 00:15:35,360
Qin.

374
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:36,960
We found something!

375
00:15:42,670 --> 00:15:43,480
What is it?

376
00:15:43,750 --> 00:15:44,630
We dug something up.

377
00:15:54,880 --> 00:15:59,400
♪The old walkie-talkie I treasure♪

378
00:16:02,440 --> 00:16:07,240
♪The birthday surprise
you gave me that year♪

379
00:16:09,960 --> 00:16:15,320
♪Its buttons worn
and weathered with time♪

380
00:16:15,840 --> 00:16:21,200
♪Still echoing your words,
"Be brave and keep moving on"♪

381
00:16:23,200 --> 00:16:31,160
♪The old train rolled over
our reluctance to part♪

382
00:16:31,800 --> 00:16:36,840
♪You waved goodbye
and faded into the night♪

383
00:16:38,880 --> 00:16:47,200
♪I used to think
we'd always have more time♪

384
00:16:47,200 --> 00:16:53,040
♪But that goodbye became the last♪

385
00:16:54,520 --> 00:17:02,640
♪I carry the warmth you left behind♪

386
00:17:03,320 --> 00:17:08,360
♪Making my way
through every door in life♪

387
00:17:10,160 --> 00:17:18,200
♪Whenever a train
whistle sounds at night♪

388
00:17:18,480 --> 00:17:25,720
♪I suddenly long to call out to you♪

389
00:17:25,920 --> 00:17:30,360
♪Can you hear me?♪

390
00:17:30,360 --> 00:17:34,160
♪Can you hear me?♪

391
00:17:34,160 --> 00:17:41,600
♪Let the old receiver
carry the words I never said♪

392
00:17:41,600 --> 00:17:49,360
♪I've taken on
both your duty and your love♪

393
00:17:49,680 --> 00:17:55,280
♪This train has no return, and when I
look back, you're no longer waiting♪

394
00:17:57,160 --> 00:18:00,760
♪After all these years♪

395
00:18:03,280 --> 00:18:10,760
♪How I wish I could
talk to you just one more time♪

396
00:18:11,640 --> 00:18:12,960
♪And tell you♪

397
00:18:14,160 --> 00:18:17,440
♪I haven't let you down♪
